OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham 20mph limit would be
OL,4,A'life saving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Midlands transport boss has said
OL,7,Fthat introducing a 20mph speed limit on
OL,8,FBirmingham's non-A class roads would be
OL,9,Fa "life-saving measure".
OL,11,FMat MacDonald is road safety
OL,12,Fcommissioner for the region and says he
OL,13,Fbacks Birmingham City Council's idea to
OL,14,Fintroduce the limitations.
OL,16,FThe measure would involve B, C and
OL,17,Funclassified routes within city
OL,18,Fconfines.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
