OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham 20mph limit would be
OL,4,A'life saving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority has been discussing the
OL,7,Fmeasure for several years, after it
OL,8,Fdeclared a road safety emergency in
OL,9,FJuly 2024, but plans would need to go
OL,10,Fthrough consultation before being
OL,11,Fadopted.
